# africode_urls.txt — Source URLs for Zara's --source web pipeline
# =====================================================
# These URLs are scraped by data_pipeline.py (--source web) to gather
# African fintech API documentation and cybersecurity/compliance reference
# material.
#
# NOTE ON FILENAME: this file MUST be named exactly "africode_urls.txt" to
# match data_pipeline.py's default --urls argument. An earlier version of
# this file was committed as "Africode_urls" (different case, no .txt
# extension), which meant `python data_pipeline.py --source web` without an
# explicit --urls flag would silently look for a file that didn't exist.
#
# Usage:
#   python data_pipeline.py --source web --urls africode_urls.txt --output zara_web
#
# Add more URLs below as you discover good sources.
# Lines starting with # are ignored.

